cities.json.gz is a compressed, field-reduced and population-sorted adaptation of
GeoNames cities15000.txt, admin1CodesASCII.txt and countryInfo.txt, provided locally
for this build. Cities with timezones absent from the build system's tzdata are
excluded. No endorsement by GeoNames is implied. Code remains under the repository
MIT license. Regenerate with tools/build_world_clock_data.py.
